      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. You mentioned \"chaotic nature\" for Profile B. To be more specific for the report, are you suggesting that these types of communal or traditional lifestyles are inherently less stable or more prone to risk than a more individualized Western lifestyle? I want to make sure we aren't just penalizing cultural differences.",
